  "body": "Currently we use `executemany` to insert multiple rows to the DB, but `psycopg2` simply calls `execute` in a loop. This is annoying as when trying to insert hundreds or thousands of rows the RTT to the database can really slow things down.\r\n\r\nWe should consider manually batching up inserts, as a single insert statement can insert multiple rows.",
